# What CI's ml job installs to run `python -m ml.models.check` and `pytest ml/tests` (docs/infra §2).
# No torch or CUDA: the tests that need them skip. The versions are ml/requirements.lock's; onnxruntime
# is the CPU build of the lock's onnxruntime-gpu, at the same version.
#   uv pip compile ml/requirements-ci.in -c ml/requirements.lock --generate-hashes \
#     --python-version 3.12 --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 --no-header -o ml/requirements-ci.txt
